00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:18.450
And this is essentially a
binary encoded payload.

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.130
This is what we
would call bronze.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:23.430
So what I need to do is I just
take this table and I just need

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:27.840
to go ahead and provide it back
to our trusty friend Copilot.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.780
So I just go ahead
and pop it in.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:32.780
And what you're going
to notice is that one

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:33.620
of the things you want to do

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.080
with Copilot is you
have these skills.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.490
The skills are great.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:41.340
But you also want to
have deterministic code

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:45.540
that the AI can invoke so,
every time you're trying

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.840
to have it do something, you
