00:22:57.300 --> 00:22:59.700
to be able to use
these tips to figure

00:22:59.700 --> 00:23:02.100
out exactly what the shape
of my data is, right?

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:04.500
So the idea that I'm
trying to convey is that,

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:08.010
when you're a human being and
you have a bronze dataset

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:10.770
and you take a look at
your data, the same kind

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:15.660
of cognitive analysis that we do
