00:28:53.760 --> 00:28:54.900
So this might take one hour.

00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:55.830
This might take two hours.

00:28:55.830 --> 00:28:57.180
It might take 30 minutes.

00:28:57.180 --> 00:28:58.410
It doesn't matter.

00:28:58.410 --> 00:29:00.630
And then, at the very
